{"text": "EMPLOYER'S FIRST REPORT OF INJURY OR ILLNESS (Form\nE-1.2)\nFiled with the New Mexico Workers' Compensation Administration. Carrier:\nChaparral Employers Mutual. Claim no. CEM-WC-25-0077412.\n\nEmployer\nCascabel Cold Storage, LLC, 2800 West Amador Avenue, Las Cruces, NM 88005.\nFEIN 85-4418720. Policy WC-NM-0044187-25. Contact: Hank Brubaker, warehouse\nmanager, 575-555-0151.\n\nWorker\n Name: Efraín Mondragón-Solís (payroll shows Efrain Mondragon)\n SSN: 672-78-6049 · Date of birth: 12/09/1979 · Hired: 04/15/2021\n Home: 1455 Calle de Alvarez, Space 22, Mesilla, NM 88046 · Phone:\n575.555.0106 (wife, Guadalupe Solís, answers; he speaks Spanish only)\n Job: forklift operator, freezer dock · Average weekly wage: $842.60\n\nInjury\n Date and time: 11/04/2025, 2:40 a.m. · Reported to employer: same shift\n What happened: A stand-up reach truck (Raymond 7500, serial no.\nRY7500BA44187, fleet tag FL-09) driven by a co-worker backed over the\nworker's left foot at dock door 6.\n Injury: crush injury to the left foot with fractures of the second and third\nmetatarsals (ICD-10 S92.3)\n Treated at: Organ Mountain Regional Hospital, emergency department;\nadmitted. MRN OM-20441877. Surgeon: Dr. Parisa Nouri.\n Post-accident drug and alcohol screen: negative.\n\nPrepared by H. Brubaker on 11/5/25.\n\nADJUSTER FILE NOTES — Latrice Uzoma, Chaparral\n Nov. 6: Three-point contact done. Spoke with Mrs. Solís through the language\nline. Worker had open reduction and pinning on 11/5; non-weight-bearing 8 to\n10 weeks. Compensable; no dispute from the employer.\n Nov. 6: TTD rate calculated at two-thirds of the average weekly wage: $561.73\nper week under NMSA 1978, § 52-1-25. First check to issue 11/18/2025.\n Nov. 7: Mr. Brubaker called. He says the worker's I-9 was completed with a\nSocial Security card that the payroll service later flagged as a mismatch. I told\nhim benefits do not depend on that and not to raise it with the family.\n Nov. 7: Telematics download requested for the reach truck, unit ID\nTMX44187720, to confirm speed and the backup alarm. Employer to add the\ncase to its OSHA 300 log.\n Nov. 10: Reserve set: medical $48,000, indemnity $14,500. Hospital estimate\nreceived, $31,206.44.\n Nov. 10: Wife asked whether checks can be direct-deposited. Bank details\ntaken by phone: routing 103824811, account 2204417788. Efraín's cousin in El\nPaso will drive him to follow-up visits; mileage to be reimbursed.\n\nL. Uzoma · luzoma@chaparralmutual.example · direct 505-555-0139 ext. 4417", "kind": "PDF", "detail": "2 pages · 386 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Efraín Mondragón-Solís", "Guadalupe Solís", "Hank Brubaker", "Dr. Parisa Nouri", "Latrice Uzoma", "Mr. Brubaker", "Efraín"], "companies": ["Chaparral Employers Mutual", "Chaparral Mutual"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Las Cruces", "Mesilla", "Chaparral", "El Paso"], "health": ["crush injury", "fractures", "open reduction", "pinning", "non-weight-bearing", "telematics", "hospital estimate"], "sensitive": ["Social Security card", "Wife", "Efraín's cousin"], "names": ["Efraín Mondragón-Solís", "Efrain Mondragon", "Guadalupe Solís", "Hank Brubaker", "Dr. Parisa Nouri", "Latrice", "Mr. Brubaker"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 228.30000000447035, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 27, "end": 33, "text": "INJURY", "kind": "health", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "INJURY"}, {"start": 73, "end": 83, "text": "New Mexico", "kind": "region", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "New Mexico"}, {"start": 84, "end":